516f09fe-bbaf-45e2-9f4b-8bc991a5189d	About Us	about	<h3>About Gamebite</h3><p>Welcome to Gamebite, your ultimate destination for high-quality, instant-play HTML5 games. We bring together a diverse catalog of fun and engaging games that you can play directly in your browser on mobile, tablet, or desktop.</p>	published	About Gamebite - Play Free HTML5 Games Online	Discover and play free HTML5 games instantly on Gamebite. No downloads or installations required.	about, gamebite, play free games, html5 games	2026-07-19 02:13:15.83637	2026-07-19 02:13:15.83637
85bbdad9-5460-499c-a0d7-b63bc22e2a6a	Privacy Policy	privacy	<h3>Privacy Policy</h3><p>At Gamebite, we take your privacy seriously. This privacy policy describes what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights to control your personal data.</p>	published	Privacy Policy - Gamebite	Read the privacy policy of Gamebite to learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal data.	privacy policy, gamebite, privacy, data protection	2026-07-19 02:13:15.839678	2026-07-19 02:13:15.839678
4756d162-1825-451e-82c5-e56c5d10c8bd	Terms of Service	terms	<h3>Terms of Service</h3><p>By accessing and playing games on Gamebite, you agree to comply with our Terms of Service. Please read these terms carefully before using our platform.</p>	published	Terms of Service - Gamebite	Review the Terms of Service for using the Gamebite platform and playing free online games.	terms of service, terms, gamebite	2026-07-19 02:13:15.840051	2026-07-19 02:13:15.840051
f5db974f-809d-4306-beb8-3d6438623fe1	Contact Us	contact	<h3>Contact Gamebite</h3><p>Have questions, feedback, or business inquiries? Get in touch with the Gamebite team. We would love to hear from you!</p>	published	Contact Us - Gamebite Support & Inquiries	Get in touch with the Gamebite support, feedback, and business teams. We are here to help.	contact, gamebite support, business inquiry	2026-07-19 02:13:15.840298	2026-07-19 02:13:15.840298
06ede19b-be29-4748-8fbf-dbbb661c6c66	Frequently Asked Questions	faq	[{"q":"Is Gamebite free to use?","a":"Yes! All games on Gamebite are completely free to play directly in your web browser."},{"q":"Do I need to download games?","a":"No, there are no downloads or installations required. Just click and play!"},{"q":"Can I play games on my phone?","a":"Absolutely. Gamebite is fully optimized for mobile devices, tablets, and desktop computers."}]	published	Frequently Asked Questions - Gamebite Help Center	Find quick answers to common questions about playing games, account creation, and platform compatibility on Gamebite.	faq, help center, gamebite help, common questions	2026-07-19 02:13:15.840584	2026-07-19 02:13:15.840584
